\ -12 & 44 & -33 \\\\ 25 & 30 & 41\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "The minor of ${d}_{23}=-33$ (second row, third column) is the determinant of the remaining entries when the column and row containing $-33$ are removed: \n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}10 & 2 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & -33 \\\\ 25 & 30 & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor of ${d}_{23}=-33$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}[\\begin{aligned}10 & 2 \\\\ 25 & 30\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}10 & 2 \\\\ 25 & 30\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =10\\cdot 30-2\\cdot 25 \\\\  & =300-50 \\\\  & =250.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-127698/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2e1b4442-eca7-5283-9d5d-5bcbd1d67975"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-127698"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-1092/selection/286fb92e9ba180b012d241bb7e762701483c9c864420d9df6597147f2e2fb458" :answer/id #uuid "9c79abcb-ee2a-52c0-a655-2eb3b3298fed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "28" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1092/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "ed3dd8dd-9bcf-5d78-8296-626c52cc9433" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1092/selection/a20b3c9808c291c56ec5bfc5f0f93a856fc692714ca7ebd36c5e4bc361f7075c" :answer/id #uuid "84521bb6-d919-5947-9e7c-4b07a209f74d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "42" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1092/selection/25b335c1798b7b6a4cb13a35c15bf802d740cecd154b47b5e805a756e83b1528" :answer/id #uuid "beed0687-2ccd-5451-9b6e-1c9d14f2afed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-42" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1092/selection/6d8a7c7e73b503e82ee3fdeaeeda8131c0106d9ecb6a16ba218483b62acd0090" :answer/id #uuid "c225dd50-8746-5bc3-b0e3-3dd591ccbab8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-18" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1092/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "93d591c2-000d-5aae-9b6c-7936672e8053" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-1092/selection/a20b3c9808c291c56ec5bfc5f0f93a856fc692714ca7ebd36c5e4bc361f7075c" :answer-field/choices ["q-1092/selection/286fb92e9ba180b012d241bb7e762701483c9c864420d9df6597147f2e2fb458" "q-1092/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" "q-1092/selection/a20b3c9808c291c56ec5bfc5f0f93a856fc692714ca7ebd36c5e4bc361f7075c" "q-1092/selection/25b335c1798b7b6a4cb13a35c15bf802d740cecd154b47b5e805a756e83b1528" "q-1092/selection/6d8a7c7e73b503e82ee3fdeaeeda8131c0106d9ecb6a16ba218483b62acd0090"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-1092" :question/id #uuid "845a8110-db5a-5eb7-8c6a-c2552c5f87a4" :question/math-academy-id "q-1092" :question/problem "Calculate the minor of the entry ${b}_{22}$ in the matrix\n$B=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 13 & -6 \\\\ 2 & 7 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & 4\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "The minor of ${b}_{22}=7$ (second row, second column) is the determinant of the remaining entries when the column and row containing $7$ are removed: \n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}3 & ∗ & -6 \\\\ ∗ & 7 & ∗ \\\\ 5 & ∗ & 4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n \n\nSo, the minor of ${b}_{22}=7$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}[\\begin{aligned}3 & -6 \\\\ 5 & 4\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & -6 \\\\ 5 & 4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot 4-(-6)\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =12-(-30) \\\\  & =42.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-1092/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2e1b4442-eca7-5283-9d5d-5bcbd1d67975"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-1092"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-319110/field-1/283bc09f1a097ae8400558511ca45f1013e17c797fdb7407be52694190fd744b" :answer/id #uuid "bbb2ee60-64cf-51b0-a6af-56bc76d2af14" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-15" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-319110/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "ef9a26f0-c0a2-5efa-9f1d-fad25349c34c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-319110/field-1/283bc09f1a097ae8400558511ca45f1013e17c797fdb7407be52694190fd744b" :answer-field/choices ["q-319110/field-1/283bc09f1a097ae8400558511ca45f1013e17c797fdb7407be52694190fd744b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-319110" :question/id #uuid "6f9c853e-7fa9-5b18-a1e7-f539794d4106" :question/math-academy-id "q-319110" :question/problem "For the matrix\n$Y=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 6 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}].$\nfind the minor ${M}_{32}$ of the entry ${y}_{32}.$\n\n${M}_{32}=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "The minor of ${y}_{32}=-1$ (third row, second column) is the determinant of the remaining entries when the column and row containing $-1$ are removed: \n\n$$\nY=[\\begin{aligned}1 & ∗ & 5 \\\\ 3 & ∗ & 0 \\\\ ∗ & -1 & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor of ${y}_{32}=-1$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{32} & =\\text{det}[\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(1)\\cdot 0-3\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =0-15 \\\\  & =-15.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-319110/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2e1b4442-eca7-5283-9d5d-5bcbd1d67975"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-319110"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-69760/selection/6413b52cdbfaad5b0f3ffdcda74492dd5e5ca3ca2a96757b04e8a931ee01a6cf" :answer/id #uuid "06ee0f7e-4c6c-592a-957e-e0a446147590" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{2}-2{y}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69760/selection/37a2e8c2718ee73b41f6ec3c55336886a36869cd968db78bf0ca1625c6234aec" :answer/id #uuid "eb9fe303-788d-5158-9a70-2cf60139edda" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{2}-2{x}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69760/selection/3ef202e253060ea8d83d4f5953212aef84f2416e6f0e10242b1f8ab21cb730c1" :answer/id #uuid "6bb0615c-e008-5893-b3f5-66480db07b6a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{y}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69760/selection/fcc4782dd0314f007636f80109b5d0be9963c8fd0992792926abe53ecc2bdcab" :answer/id #uuid "f1b1d660-3595-55a5-95a2-11f7cd546d9e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{x}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69760/selection/d5ccc67a0af7ed709899adf357dd9d87e71344eb5b1aa1680a11724ea1238f78" :answer/id #uuid "cd4de354-b3de-5812-8d84-64885db8bc7b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-69760/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "162724ee-f180-51e9-9c63-4ab63212c96a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-69760/selection/3ef202e253060ea8d83d4f5953212aef84f2416e6f0e10242b1f8ab21cb730c1" :answer-field/choices ["q-69760/selection/6413b52cdbfaad5b0f3ffdcda74492dd5e5ca3ca2a96757b04e8a931ee01a6cf" "q-69760/selection/37a2e8c2718ee73b41f6ec3c55336886a36869cd968db78bf0ca1625c6234aec" "q-69760/selection/3ef202e253060ea8d83d4f5953212aef84f2416e6f0e10242b1f8ab21cb730c1" "q-69760/selection/fcc4782dd0314f007636f80109b5d0be9963c8fd0992792926abe53ecc2bdcab" "q-69760/selection/d5ccc67a0af7ed709899adf357dd9d87e71344eb5b1aa1680a11724ea1238f78"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-69760" :question/id #uuid "b34c44d7-ca23-51bd-b337-4479b87f5ce2" :question/math-academy-id "q-69760" :question/problem "What is the minor of ${t}_{33}$ in the matrix\n$T=[\\begin{aligned}y-x & x & {y}^{2} \\\\ -x & y+x & 1 \\\\ {x}^{2} & {y}^{2} & {x}^{2}\\end{aligned}]?$" :question/worked-solution "First, we remove the third row and third column:\n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}y-x & x & ∗ \\\\ -x & y+x & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & {x}^{2}\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNext, we calculate the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det[\\begin{aligned}y-x & x \\\\ -x & y+x\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}y-x & x \\\\ -x & y+x\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(y-x)\\cdot (y+x)-x\\cdot (-x) \\\\  & ={y}^{2}-{x}^{2}+{x}^{2} \\\\  & ={y}^{2}-\\cancel{{x}^{2}}+\\cancel{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & ={y}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-69760/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1ff88785-9281-5431-86d8-95fd89866787"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-69760"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-1099"] :question/problem "What is the minor of ${d}_{32}$ in the matrix\n$D=[\\begin{aligned}3s & -{r}^{2} & 2t \\\\ -r & 0 & r \\\\ 5t & 4r & 1\\end{aligned}]?$" :question/worked-solution "First, we remove the third row and second column:\n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}3s & ∗ & 2t \\\\ -r & ∗ & r \\\\ ∗ & 4r & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNext, we calculate the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det[\\begin{aligned}3s & 2t \\\\ -r & r\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}3s & 2t \\\\ -r & r\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3s\\cdot r-2t\\cdot (-r) \\\\  & =3rs-(-2rt) \\\\  & =3rs+2rt\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-275501/field-1/c65d1a25d10878a5b45a8127d50c200438f43cb9e73dddf139a5b16074a84dcb" :answer/id #uuid "51178909-aa0b-5954-8261-958a2c91b4a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10-z" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275501/field-1/991582ef85c7be19caa6395fa81e5a3841863fc9c5e37ef6854ff1de5ad74024" :answer/id #uuid "3533297a-1039-56a0-b0cc-22dc1b6c0056" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10+z" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275501/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "bf6a41e9-50ac-558f-a56d-814d22a0cce6" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275501/field-1/c65d1a25d10878a5b45a8127d50c200438f43cb9e73dddf139a5b16074a84dcb" :answer-field/choices ["q-275501/field-1/c65d1a25d10878a5b45a8127d50c200438f43cb9e73dddf139a5b16074a84dcb" "q-275501/field-1/991582ef85c7be19caa6395fa81e5a3841863fc9c5e37ef6854ff1de5ad74024"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275501" :question/id #uuid "03e055b5-d0f8-53f2-9e9e-d73f97dbbc13" :question/math-academy-id "q-275501" :question/problem "For the matrix\n$A=[\\begin{aligned}x & 3 & y \\\\ 2 & x & z \\\\ 1 & w & 5\\end{aligned}],$\nfind the minor ${M}_{12}$ of the element ${a}_{12}.$\n\n${M}_{12}=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "To evaluate the minor of ${a}_{12},$ we remove the first row and second column: \n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & 3 & ∗ \\\\ 2 & ∗ & z \\\\ 1 & ∗ & 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor of ${a}_{12}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{12} & =det[\\begin{aligned}2 & z \\\\ 1 & 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & z \\\\ 1 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\cdot 5-z\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =10-z\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-275501/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1ff88785-9281-5431-86d8-95fd89866787"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-275501"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-128030/selection/4d9451d4999958bd755339a0a4a819adfafea764c53e4c36c5f1a103891bbc53" :answer/id #uuid "5fd0c10a-c26c-572b-9a05-84069587b78b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{f}^{2}+{g}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128030/selection/914dfc51c94a1736da3da97b139f815dba02b58be849dd044d6628d2cfa85ba8" :answer/id #uuid "40934120-ed89-554b-91fb-88b74a122a0b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "gf(f-g)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128030/selection/e22c1ed0b52db6a77ef59a9d507d55c73451e43eee54be1c2c41e375520c3ace" :answer/id #uuid "970311e3-4e14-55b5-93f4-ec2948735196" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "gf-3